  "contract": [
    "B_NO_LOCK creates anonymous cache backing with pages mapped as needed",
    "swappable anonymous cache is selected when swap support is enabled",
    "lock_memory_etc wires area ranges and physical pages, retaining the address space",
    "successful lock must be balanced with unlock_memory_etc and exactly matching team/address/size/flags",
    "B_READ_DEVICE requests writable backing; it does not itself perform DMA"
  ]
